      "question": "Differentiate and explain headlines, subheads, body copy, pull quotes, and image captions with examples of their usage in magazine production.",
      "solution_html": "<ul class='list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 my-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Answer</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Headlines</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>The main title of an article used to attract readers.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Example: “Climate Change and Kerala Floods”</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Subheads</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Secondary headings that divide the article into sections.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Example: “Causes of Flooding”</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>The main written content of the article containing detailed information.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Important quotations highlighted separately for emphasis.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Example: “We must act now to protect nature.”</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Short descriptions given below photographs explaining the image.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Example: “Rescue operations during Kerala floods.”</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Difference</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Headlines summarize the topic</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Subheads organize content</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Body copy gives detailed information</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Pull quotes emphasize key statements</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>These elements improve readability and visual appeal.</li></ul>",
      "source_exam": "Second semester BA/BSc/BVocFYUGP April 2026",
