      "question": "Explain the major functions of a newspaper, including how it informs, educates, entertains, and influences readers, with examples from daily life.",
      "solution_html": "<ul class='list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 my-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Answer</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Informing</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Newspapers provide current information on politics, economy, sports, weather, and international</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>events.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Example: Election news and traffic updates.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Educating</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>They spread knowledge through editorials, educational supplements, and awareness articles.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Example: Health awareness campaigns.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Entertaining</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Newspapers entertain readers through comics, puzzles, cinema pages, and feature articles.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Example: Weekend supplements and cartoons.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Influencing Public Opinion</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Editorials and opinion columns influence people’s attitudes toward social and political issues.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Example: Campaigns against corruption and drug abuse.</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Additional Functions</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Advertising products and services</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Providing job information</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Preserving historical records</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Thus, newspapers play an important role in informing, educating, entertaining, and influencing</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>society.</li></ul>",
